                                                "sense_id": "94b39b19-4fa8-3e35-b894-54d9ef16f32b",
                                                "text": "If you want to improve your organization's NPS, you need to follow up with your detractors, passives, and promoters to understand why they answered your question as they did and what you can do better in the future."
