                                                "sense_id": "90773a19-e7dc-3af6-b544-8d1eee2e8dc0",
                                                "text": "Reductions In Both Size And Weight Offered By Integrated Passives\nYou may not know it yet, but if you're like most consumers, you want integrated passives."
                                            },
